## Context

Imperial Dragon voice. `celebrate` and `end-session` are generic names.
`roar` and `lair` fit the harness register.

## Actions

1. `git mv skills/celebrate skills/roar` — rename directory.
2. Update `skills/roar/SKILL.md`: change any self-references from `celebrate`
   to `roar`.
3. `git mv skills/end-session skills/lair` — rename directory.
4. Update `skills/lair/SKILL.md`: change any self-references from `end-session`
   to `lair`.
5. Update `STATE.md` "Morning review" and any other references to the old names.
6. Search for `celebrate` and `end-session` in all skill files and docs;
   update call sites (`/celebrate` → `/roar`, `/end-session` → `/lair`).

## Exit criteria

- `skills/celebrate/` and `skills/end-session/` do not exist.
- `skills/roar/` and `skills/lair/` exist with correct content.
- No remaining references to the old skill names in skills/, STATE.md, or docs/.
